                  held-out data (WRITE = 0.311, LOAD = 0.079); ISA turned out dynamic and circuit-level.
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Suppressor blind spot:</strong> greedy JCCS deflation misses components
                  whose removal improves accuracy (two NIAH suppressors emerged during joint ablation).
                </li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Dense variable tracking:</strong> resists sparsification across K ∈ [6, 64]
